{
  "slug": "presente-irregular",
  "number": 6,
  "part": 2,
  "level": "A1",
  "title": "The irregular present",
  "tagline": "Stem changes (quiero, puedo, pido), «yo» forms in -go, and the truly irregular verbs.",
  "goal": "Conjugate stem-changing verbs, the verbs with an irregular yo form, and ir, dar, saber and ver in the present.",
  "minutes": 12,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "botas",
      "title": "Stem-changing verbs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In many common verbs the stressed vowel of the stem changes. The change happens in every form **except nosotros** (and vosotros), so the pattern looks like a boot."
        },
        {
          "type": "conjugation",
          "persons": ["yo", "tú", "él / ella / usted", "nosotros", "ellos / ellas / ustedes"],
          "verbs": [
            { "verb": "querer", "meaning": "to want (e → ie)", "forms": ["qu{ie}ro", "qu{ie}res", "qu{ie}re", "queremos", "qu{ie}ren"] },
            { "verb": "poder", "meaning": "can (o → ue)", "forms": ["p{ue}do", "p{ue}des", "p{ue}de", "podemos", "p{ue}den"] },
            { "verb": "pedir", "meaning": "to ask for (e → i)", "forms": ["p{i}do", "p{i}des", "p{i}de", "pedimos", "p{i}den"] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": ["e → ie", "o → ue", "e → i"],
          "rows": [
            ["*pensar, empezar, entender, preferir, cerrar, sentir*", "*dormir, volver, encontrar, costar, recordar, almorzar*", "*servir, repetir, seguir, vestir(se), medir*"],
            ["*Empiezo a las ocho.*", "*¿Cuánto cuesta?*", "*¿Me repites, por favor?*"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "note",
          "text": "*jugar* is unique: u → ue. *Juego al fútbol, juegas, juega, jugamos, juegan.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "yo-go",
      "title": "Verbs with an irregular «yo»",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": ["Verb", "yo", "the rest"],
          "rows": [
            ["*hacer* (to do)", "*{hago}*", "*haces, hace…*"],
            ["*poner* (to put)", "*{pongo}*", "*pones, pone…*"],
            ["*salir* (to go out)", "*{salgo}*", "*sales, sale…*"],
            ["*traer* (to bring)", "*{traigo}*", "*traes, trae…*"],
            ["*tener* (to have)", "*{tengo}*", "*tienes, tiene… (e → ie too)*"],
            ["*venir* (to come)", "*{vengo}*", "*vienes, viene…*"],
            ["*decir* (to say)", "*{digo}*", "*dices, dice… (e → i too)*"],
            ["*conocer* (to know someone)", "*{conozco}*", "*conoces, conoce…*"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "irregulares",
      "title": "The truly irregular ones",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "conjugation",
          "persons": ["yo", "tú", "él / ella / usted", "nosotros", "ellos / ellas / ustedes"],
          "verbs": [
            { "verb": "ir", "meaning": "to go", "forms": ["{voy}", "{vas}", "{va}", "{vamos}", "{van}"] },
            { "verb": "dar", "meaning": "to give", "forms": ["{doy}", "das", "da", "damos", "dan"] },
            { "verb": "saber", "meaning": "to know (facts)", "forms": ["{sé}", "sabes", "sabe", "sabemos", "saben"] },
            { "verb": "ver", "meaning": "to see", "forms": ["{veo}", "ves", "ve", "vemos", "ven"] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "tip",
          "text": "*ir a* + infinitive is the everyday future: *Voy a comer* = I'm going to eat. See [[16]]."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
